    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/releases/tag/vercel-ai-v3.0.3"/>
    <title>Vercel AI SDK Provider (v3.0.3)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improvements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client:&lt;/strong&gt; Inherits the three surface-identity headers (&lt;code&gt;X-Mem0-Source&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;X-Application&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;X-Mem0-Client&lt;/code&gt;) from the TypeScript SDK bump, so platform calls made through the Vercel AI SDK provider are now correctly attributed (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7326&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7326/hovercard&quot;&gt;#7326&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
