  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/656099147/pi-agent-v0.3.1</id>
    <updated>2026-09-18T11:22:24Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/releases/tag/pi-agent-v0.3.1"/>
    <title>Mem0 Pi Agent Plugin (v0.3.1)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improvements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Telemetry:&lt;/strong&gt; Events are no longer delivered twice, no longer lose parked events, and now attribute each event to the plugin that produced it. The &lt;code&gt;plugin_version&lt;/code&gt; wire field reflects the fixed release (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7323&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7323/hovercard&quot;&gt;#7323&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7324&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7324/hovercard&quot;&gt;#7324&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7358&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7358/hovercard&quot;&gt;#7358&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
