    <title>Mem0 OpenClaw Plugin (v1.2.0)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Config:&lt;/strong&gt; Added &lt;code&gt;keyFingerprint&lt;/code&gt; to the config schema for install-count deduplication; installs are now counted once per key rather than on every activation (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7325&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7325/hovercard&quot;&gt;#7325&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Telemetry:&lt;/strong&gt; Events are no longer delivered twice, and the &lt;code&gt;plugin_version&lt;/code&gt; field now reflects the plugin that produced the event (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7323&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7323/hovercard&quot;&gt;#7323&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7324&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7324/hovercard&quot;&gt;#7324&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7358&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/mem0ai/mem0/pull/7358/hovercard&quot;&gt;#7358&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
